{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "540b5c5d5bc227d68e73221cbb0e4cdcf26a4b4255cfd0a4a44a18464e516009", "ja": "（ついに、765プロ劇場の初公演が始まる。\nさすがにみんな、緊張してるな……）", "zh": "（765艺能剧场的首次公演终于要开始了。\n大家果然都很紧张呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c413ac00c6c57d256337ca995e7a95fa6c7d1f19343d81aa957034da7304e9cf", "ja": "{$P$}……\nお、お疲れ様ですぅ……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n辛、辛苦你了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "95f8d44097e450c0d16e2eafd70faf3fc4b28ce3e7a13eebc96d54c3d5c57d66", "ja": "ゆ、雪歩？\n顔が真っ青だけど、大丈夫か……？", "zh": "雪、雪步？\n你怎么一脸铁青，还好吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7084377dbe269d79b3c1d2f177f5ada74ad6584709f6c44d5577f6d99635910e", "ja": "うぅっ、だ、大丈夫じゃありません……。", "zh": "呜呜，一、一点也不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "973852b68e53f393d420463b8d16744012c23333c387f72ecd79017e76bf6f32", "ja": "みんなの劇場の初公演なのに、\nもし私が失敗して泥を塗ったりしたら……。", "zh": "大家在剧场的首次公演，\n要是因为我失误而前功尽弃的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b1c3b8e5dc00c2aee1ce37fb780fbe29ba87f3988cff93b68d76439095b0cd10", "ja": "みんなに合わせる顔がありません！\n穴に埋まるだけじゃ、済まされませんよぉ！", "zh": "那我哪还有脸面对大家！\n光是挖洞把自己埋起来也不足以赔罪啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_1006_p", "source_sha256": "518f6cc023cb9d76050049284d4606e59c49af01d6a4dff2dae9aaa92fcbb3b5", "ja": "落ち着くんだ、雪歩。今までだってたくさん\nライブしてきただろ？　それを思い出せば……。", "zh": "冷静点，雪步。你一路走来不是经历过了\n好多场演唱会吗？只要想起那些经验的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4659c739f099be10c45a2fe58d71ea0bb596f02403912a9c6420884832d82229", "ja": "今までとは全然違いますぅ……！\nだって、今日はみんなにとっても大事な日ですし……。", "zh": "这次跟以往完全不同……！\n今天对新人们而言可是非常重要的日子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8903ac32b2e1644a08c983687db497f5580f7517fd519786b6715b8adcd9488f", "ja": "初めてのステージだっていう人も、\nたくさんいます……。", "zh": "其中还有不少人，\n是第一次登台演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "12d23a5ea72acad450ecf0e619fc6280151281730022ec67eaf1f2349fb1348f", "ja": "そんな大事なステージで失敗しちゃったらって\n思うと、私……足が震えて……。", "zh": "一想到自已可能在这么重要的表演上失误，\n我就……双腿抖个不停……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_1010", "source_sha256": "b268a6b3f2974e59c886e7ba1799df43f3d41ee9dc2877e089b3b60e33e6519f", "ja": "やさしく諭す", "zh": "温柔开导她", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "2f0902cc3238ef7c96fe7396abc0318ef10417af3c83877e1f34c161878edcd6", "ja": "雪歩、よく聞くんだ。\n確かに今日はみんなの初ステージかもしれない。", "zh": "雪步，你听我说。\n今天对新人们而言或许是首次登台没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2001_p", "source_sha256": "4d10f76626389cbb03bf19738de83599c4f61e263fdb1714db671a682c17c5d0", "ja": "けど、雪歩だって、この新しい\n765プロ劇場のステージに立つのは初めてだろ？", "zh": "但对雪步而言，\n这不也是你第一次站上765艺能剧场的全新舞台吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d272be7a220c31d8fd81f6d68c08f8222e5da6ef9419c6f7d7f59306bd003345", "ja": "は、はい。それはそうですけど……。", "zh": "是、是的，话是这么说没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2003_p", "source_sha256": "74f87f7943f5f226c950d5973711ad92a0e065278a2c03f12b642ee7317d4c68", "ja": "なら雪歩も、他の子と何も変わらない。\n先輩だからって、必要以上に気負うことないんだ。", "zh": "所以雪步其实也和其他人没有两样。\n不需要因为自己年资稍长，就背负这么大的压力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2004_p", "source_sha256": "a33e154aed21b14bb57010f2ae6bfdd5ca466916313ca628d1ccfb29f0922150", "ja": "ステージはひとりじゃなくて、\nみんなで作りあげるものだろ？", "zh": "这次的演出不是你一个人的责任，\n而是要大家同心协力不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4e1cafa01d03f3a3c32c7190ffdd35c3795fa02d971c99b62f4524f2470da6e5", "ja": "みんなで…………。", "zh": "同心协力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cfc96af3bc3816ad7ef297b17e179c82758dad79483e4f4b5820d1826c240756", "ja": "はい……そう、ですね。この初公演は、私ひとりの\nステージじゃない……みんなのステージ……。", "zh": "没错……你说得对。这场首次公演，并不是\n我一个人的舞台……而是属于大家的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3751d6e8dbf065289f0b2d26ae0df056fbbd9f9d7da03d1e4f6fb288860a50b0", "ja": "私ひとりで盛り上げようだなんて、\n勘違いもはなはだしいですよね？", "zh": "我居然想独挑整场演出的大梁，\n还真是自大得无可救药了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2008_p", "source_sha256": "07e3640c0adcf64d3c365f0bca2ff6a2bee73040894711294f5c9edb69f0b427", "ja": "はなはだしいかどうかは置いておいて、\n雪歩ひとりで全部を背負い込む必要はないよ。", "zh": "先不管是不是无可救药，\n但雪步你不用把压力都往自己身上扛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "560335cf0c5b5dfb8fbbe13ec280d160d08e07fb619566c5976c2f01003f5514", "ja": "はい……。えへへ、緊張しすぎたせいで、\n私……忘れてました。", "zh": "好的……嘿嘿，紧张过头，\n害我……都忘记了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f62ce7701efc98a86666fd17bd075839f6f5dbc511a80301a9448a69f021684a", "ja": "今日のために、みんながどれだけ頑張ってきたか。\nちゃんと知ってるのに。", "zh": "大家为了今天，背后付出了多少努力。\n我明明都有看在眼里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dd769f60f0db521245858b1ee662783ad1b5d02ac094ceacaeaf0d55e080d35f", "ja": "みんな、自分のステージをちゃんとできるって……。", "zh": "却忘了大家都有能力完成自己的表演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ee2958bc80b22c555cc91c07148798d827c605dc8e91868117b73b5e56542a4c", "ja": "みんなで並んで、手を繋いで……\nひとりずつ、歩いてるんだって。", "zh": "忘了大家正肩并着肩，手牵着手……\n一个接一个向前迈步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2013_p", "source_sha256": "f43bdb1bca07083136f842194c38ac491cd7c75ccb2d88bc4158f889221b1095", "ja": "そうだ。雪歩は雪歩ひとり分。\nまずは、雪歩の初公演を頑張ろう。", "zh": "没错，雪步要走的就是自己那一步。\n首先，就努力完成雪步的首次公演吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cfaef4761192eabc6b352ecd8cbac0a856ecaf850a09b49b252bcd0f437e608d", "ja": "わかりました！　私ひとり分の初公演……\nきっちり頑張ってきますね。", "zh": "我知道了！我自己的首次公演……\n我会好好加油的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4a7c5034d0c71d63652415b6598dd8e5f8d850242da64add74b14008881e696c", "ja": "あの……、{$P$}？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d24ec4f760c66a46334f9afcc3d5251fd863fe627366d0532c2a1c67c14eee5d", "ja": "私、劇場に呼んでもらえて……\nとってもよかったです♪", "zh": "我真的非常庆幸……\n你能邀请我到剧场来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_004yuk_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_004yuk_003_2017_p", "source_sha256": "56214c3b9c55cbaa5e4ee93a7fae802702bbd6f10dd51144e7fb0947d9a0dd8d", "ja": "（いつもの笑顔を取り戻し、ステージへ向かう雪歩）", "zh": "（雪步终于恢复了平时的笑容，迈步走向舞台。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
